/figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260825004871680428390.jpeg/SFLfAzjAIo8ks50itHEer0h0WcMj48wrn3AEPp9wBD4\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260820466372608250194.jpeg/gXbIIPHWcLDgr5hlVhCEHcIFwYnOqNWBLB9oXCwfaFw\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260819119869952284179.jpeg/UFwlucbVH6HvU5KpCawYqdYp_OkGooxA-Ql3l_kJd5c\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260818050322432204613.jpeg/wU8SfxvaL039VkNwrV8RhvKQPyomEyEnF8P2sxfD9rM\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260819073863680708651.jpeg/VzxUNf6cA3o1uLqJhRaDF941pj00MgiX1Gi9k9RovZM\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260813654429696346190.jpeg/3zjsYiwVtz1ZwDQKO88p80LMP-3bKduAHjPciR4z3Ik\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260815906902016593842.jpeg/DCUkyCJDVkY3c-OZ09G77p8Vb18f3_1gMjMzRjIzM0Y\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260816615739392201643.jpeg/-YiOV9gAMFcDBXLdaVmMLSNAiHLOgt4kgdlfGoHZXxo\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260814677970944945708.jpeg/rgTvs03PEbm4-BLeHnA6EdwHV5cGECggytrKHcrayh0\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260816615870464714698.jpeg/LBnO_rUaQsF3lSP3XPSWsnB82LWBmyGoAeC3GQHgtxk\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260814019334144568143.jpeg/ayQn-V1YL1TAjcaibXeON-jjToE--zxyc8_HbHPPx2w\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260810214969344376102.jpeg/ZcLYkooM0wwldpQ54CNstAya3doiKka65iFlU-YhZVM\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260811339042816378640.jpeg/LQubImNbJersx0zdNqePFngTGoamAdX37e6M5e3ujOU\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260812584882176905823.jpeg/M6KcgXWXMJFOMkgzgU6w3nYeOT1SZEsodqEYpHahGKQ\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260808960741376608413.jpeg/GPmvva3d9EFHh8mVT38hU9RT3DDO3HHRuDtCsLg7QrA\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260811041247232451689.jpeg/EOh57BPRxnNwxd4hBhiEY5MkHutMEMRxG1r3Fhta9xY\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260808092520448462187.jpeg/A1oqQrPhHG8OXe6DCqaRqodq6u3U43E4qc9HmanPR5k\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20210111/425260808641974272236749.jpeg/aAxcf5sYbWa6g34pnjdrfDlqMsQ_titv_GVAb_xlQG8\"/><figcaption>朴素丹  （IG@sodam_park_0908）</figcaption></figure><p>朴素丹透露，2021年拍攝動作電影《幻影》期間，常感到體力不支且極度疲憊，起初以為只是工作忙碌導致的心理低潮。直到前往醫院進行精密檢查，才被醫師診斷出脖子內長了高達13顆腫瘤，且癌細胞已轉移至淋巴。</p><p>其中最大的一顆腫瘤，甚至直接長在高音聲帶神經上，被警告若侵入神經恐有「永久失聲」的風險，必須立刻排定手術。當年她因此錯過電影的所有宣傳活動，所幸術後癌細胞並未繼續擴散，幸運免於化療療程。</p><p>雖然順利完成手術，但術後的恢復過程卻是極大的煎熬。朴素丹表示，術後整整花了 6 個月的時間，自己的聲音才逐漸恢復正常。在失去聲音與面對大病的打擊下，朴素丹當時情緒極度低落，每天都會到家附近的石村湖散步，邊走邊止不住眼淚，身邊的朋友甚至心疼地開玩笑問她：</p><p>大病一場體悟人生！朴素丹放慢步調：學會花更多時間陪伴自己</p><p>歷經這場大病關卡，朴素丹坦言自己心態產生了劇烈轉變，開始反思除了演戲之外，人生還有許多值得探索的事物。</p><p>病癒後，她選擇放慢腳步出國旅遊紓壓，學會將重心回歸到自己身上。如今重新健康地回到大眾面前，她備感珍惜，也希望能以自身的抗癌歷程，給予更多低潮中的人們勇敢面對生活的力量。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：劉在錫的民宿法則｜池睿恩爆患癌退Running Man　差1mm癌細胞轉移】池睿恩曾是《Running Man》的固定成員。（《Running Man》節目截圖）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136713876587417600986170.jpeg/_Oc9uInlWvIXvZ5vFUdTvDVrTy8PBG3-fMBDSnzAQ0o\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：劉在錫的民宿法則｜池睿恩爆患癌退Running Man　差1mm癌細胞轉移】池睿恩曾是《Running Man》的固定成員。（《Running Man》節目截圖）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"池睿恩與邊佑錫、李光洙。（Instagram@y_eunniii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136710900233801728195740.jpeg/CKDvPn7MzmTtojBBzj9U9J6TbtVtE8IzrKzNq6yszas\"/><figcaption>池睿恩與邊佑錫、李光洙。（Instagram@y_eunniii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136712090111709184294063.jpeg/y5hifQRg6wHrCWAGoK89kct2e3n6qUxEpxa11qcWtdY\"/><figcaption>池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136712093077213184950281.jpeg/YBe-eipJiLLlnG-4a4qpxiy5dc3JO4dYWWa9n1lmvZ8\"/><figcaption>池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136712095489069056652948.jpeg/_DKJlEk690Y3-rYlxqnY_Jw95uLEFUGjV7uHeVe7h3k\"/><figcaption>池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136712097800261632941603.jpeg/CEml_s69VU1PTRW-3WBpOPZgCBGN-rMpjdNdC43TXQs\"/><figcaption>池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136712100224700416089371.jpeg/Fg2vyHm7h9USAxo1VcY9ggLVOjEQOfYdYrsW92K7Fvc\"/><figcaption>池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136712091130925056412965.jpeg/lzyt8jtYasi6ufpfMH40gq95aZ-_zr56H9_2dR_f9nU\"/><figcaption>池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136712094004154368287614.jpeg/a1iYtNrMdovhDxwPLViPtBj0O7gzHv3w2TMIVNkzCFQ\"/><figcaption>池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136712096155963392912078.jpeg/HdMtR3w8D81t2ViDF-4DDP1q7A3zyCnbq3yP06t8j9M\"/><figcaption>池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136712098349715456981307.jpeg/IUIN1MIN7-eUVP8ncRSvVfRMP02uWyxa-QbgifkG4Ik\"/><figcaption>池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136712100388278272784065.jpeg/gsE5v3MLTVJRB5Y30jva7_ycx-Nu1I3F3UX9mN1F_Zg\"/><figcaption>池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136712090594054144709562.jpeg/k-BGwDT18q-ozSK55SV9lrSeEi9ucVXL8zqWefM6lnk\"/><figcaption>池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136712094243229696350897.jpeg/JspmA8fyuWQYtlg-hXmwsXAmv7o4P3bZLiBJkC4gSZA\"/><figcaption>池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136712096470536192867023.jpeg/K17kWiey8zvo-nXvFpv3kAqEmTgwbZwjsOo8T7DqPE8\"/><figcaption>池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136712098790117376651829.jpeg/0ZTjLFtPVKDGKaVuPqhiKvIfMaBfOLMFY7cVI2O3FSM\"/><figcaption>池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260528/1136712101134864384982045.jpeg/P9DSl8LGv-aTjHNfr9MGnLGh35weQXqKhyz7H4cs-x8\"/><figcaption>池睿恩（Instagram@y_eunniii）</figcaption></figure><p>16歲帥兒外型遭討論！林志穎露面吐心聲　揭林俊傑女友私下面</p><p>【本文獲「TVBS新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-20T02:39:34.882484+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2078,"images":51,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}